ss=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Night_Revels\" title=\"The Night Revels\">The Night Revels</a></b>, Turn in <a href=\"/page/Item:Cloak_of_Night_(level_28)\" title=\"Item:Cloak of Night (level 28)\">Cloak of Night (level 28)</a><br /><div style=\"display: inline-block; width: 24px;\">&#160;</div>and <b>300</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Piece_of_Darkest_Chocolate\" title=\"Item:Piece of Darkest Chocolate\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/IngIcon_PieceOfDarkestChocolate.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span> <span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Piece_of_Darkest_Chocolate\" title=\"Item:Piece of Darkest Chocolate\">Piece of Darkest Chocolate</a></b>, obtained in the <a href=\"/page/The_Night_Revels_-_Delera%27s_Graveyard\" title=\"The Night Revels - Delera&#39;s Graveyard\">Crypt</a>, in <a href=\"/page/Category:Challenges_in_Night_Revels_Crypt\" title=\"Category:Challenges in Night Revels Crypt\">any challenge</a>, and via <a href=\"/page/Item:Draught_of_Midnight\" title=\"Item:Draught of Midnight\">Draught of Midnight</a></span></span><b>120</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Spooky_Almond\" title=\"Item:Spooky Almond\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/IngIcon_SpookyAlmond.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span> <span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Spooky_Almond\" title=\"Item:Spooky Almond\">Spooky Almond</a></b>, obtained in <a href=\"/page/The_Kobolds%27_Newest_Ringleader\" title=\"The Kobolds&#39; Newest Ringleader\">The Kobolds' Newest Ringleader</a>, <a href=\"/page/Under_New_Ravagement\" title=\"Under New Ravagement\">Under New Ravagement</a></span></span><b>100</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Black_Apple\" title=\"Item:Black Apple\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/IngIcon_BlackApple.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span> <span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Black_Apple\" title=\"Item:Black Apple\">Black Apple</a></b>, obtained in <a href=\"/page/Grave_Work\" title=\"Grave Work\">Grave Work</a>, <a href=\"/page/Smashing_Pumpkins\" title=\"Smashing Pumpkins\">Smashing Pumpkins</a></span></span> at <a href=\"/page/Joe_Candymaker\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Joe Candymaker\">Joe Candymaker</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Invisibility_Guard\" title=\"Invisibility Guard\">Invisibility&#32;Guard</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Invisibility_Guard\" title=\"Invisibility Guard\">Invisibility&#32;Guard</a>:</b> This item has a chance of granting you temporary invisibility when you are hit by foes. The invisibility will not be removed when you attack or take damage, but it will wear off after 10 seconds.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Ghostly\" title=\"Ghostly\">Enhanced Ghostly</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Ghostly\" title=\"Ghostly\">Enhanced Ghostly</a>:</b> Equipping this item causes you to become partially incorporeal. Your melee attacks do not roll a miss chance for Incorporeal targets. Enemy attacks have a 15% chance to miss you due to <a href=\"/page/Incorporeal\" title=\"Incorporeal\">incorporeality</a>. You receive a +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to your <a href=\"/page/Hide\" title=\"Hide\">Hide</a> and <a href=\"/page/Move_Silently\" title=\"Move Silently\">Move Silently</a> skills.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Deathblock\" title=\"Deathblock\">Deathblock</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Deathblock\" title=\"Deathblock\">Deathblock</a>:</b> The wearer of this item is immune to all death spells and magical death effects.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Nightmare_Guard\" title=\"Nightmare Guard\">Nightmare&#32;Guard</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Nightmare_Guard\" title=\"Nightmare Guard\">Nightmare&#32;Guard</a>:</b> This item has a chance to terrorizing foes that hit you, applying a Mind Thrust effect, when you are hit by them (dealing 5d8 force damage, Will save vs. Enchantments negates). It may also expose your foes to their greatest fears, acting as a Phantasmal Killer spell.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Dodge_bonus\" title=\"Dodge bonus\"> Dodge +14%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Dodge_bonus\" title=\"Dodge bonus\"> Dodge +14%</a>:</b> +14% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Dodge.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">DR</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> 15/Good</b>: Reduces  physical damage by 15, except from Good attacks.</span></span> 15/Good</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Cloak_of_Night_(level_32).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Cloak_of_Night_%28level_32%29.png/420px-Cloak_of_Night_%28level_32%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"498\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Cloak_of_Night_%28level_32%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This Cloak is as smooth and dark as the most pitch-black of nights. Wearing it makes you difficult to spot and attack, and by awakening its powers you will enable it to aid you against creatures native to the darkness.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817202243\nCache expiry: 3600\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.097 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.158 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4306/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38847/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15517/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n105.02%  139.390     61 Template:IO\n100.00%  132.726      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  132.726      1 -total\n 96.92%  128.638      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 34.86%   46.272      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 34.23%   45.428      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 33.54%   44.513      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 33.49%   44.449     11 Template:Popup\n 32.45%   43.072      2 Template:InCategory\n 15.35%   20.378      1 Template:NightRevelsRecipe\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:97842-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817202243 and revision id 663124. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
